      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-Ipetr5">
        <head xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Hd1e98">Caput 5</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_1@1-1">Seniores.</quote>
            Cum supra distincte monuisset liberos et servos, viros et ipsas mulieres, post interpositam communem exhortationem, sic alloquitur senes et juvenes.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Dd1e111">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Hd1e113">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-d1e115">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e117" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_2@9-10">Non coacte.</quote>
            Nolite praedicare Evangelium, ut de Evangelio vivere possitis, <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e120" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_2@11-14">sed spontanee secundum Deum,</quote> id est tantum intuitu supernae mercedis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Dd1e125">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Hd1e127">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-d1e129">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e131" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_5@1-2">Similiter adolescentes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Rd1e134"><name xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Nd1e135" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e138"><seg type="qs">Postquam <pb ed="#P" n="0688C"/> seniores, quomodo praeessent</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">continuo generaliter admonendo subdit:</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-d1e148">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e150" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_5@6-10">Omnes autem invicem humilitatem insinuate,</quote>
            senes quidem docendo, juvenes autem subsequendo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Dd1e155">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Hd1e157">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-d1e159">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e161" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_6@1-1">Humiliamini.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Rd1e164"><name xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Nd1e165" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e168"><seg type="qs">Quae sit gratia quam Deus confert humilibus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sequitur congrua merces exaltationis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Dd1e178">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Hd1e180">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-d1e182">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e184" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_8@8-10">Tanquam leo rugiens,</quote>
            etc. Sicut rugitus leonis impedit aures, ne alium sonum excipiant, sic diabolus fidelium mentes terrendo, et illicita suggerendo, a via veritatis, ne vocem Christi audiant, avertit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Dd1e189">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Hd1e191">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-d1e193">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e195" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_9@5-5">Scientes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Rd1e198"><name xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Nd1e199" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e202"><seg type="qs">Tanto majorem habete fiduciam</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">pudeat vos solos prae omnibus non posse pati.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Dd1e211">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Hd1e213">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-d1e215">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0688D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e219" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_12@9-9">Scripsi.</quote>
            Vobis, inquit, <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e222" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_12@9-9">scripsi</quote> non ut imperans, sed obsecrans et contestans auctoritate Scripturarum hanc esse veram gratiam quam scribendo praedico, quia non est in alio aliquo salus, in quo oportet vos salvos fieri. Vel, obsecrans vos, ut hanc gratiam in qua statis, et qua imbuti estis, esse faciatis veram gratiam vestram et teneatis ut proficientem vobis. Qui gratiam spernit non gratiam minuit, sed hanc non suam, id est non sibi utilem reddit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Dd1e227">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Hd1e229">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-d1e231">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e233" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ipetr5_13@5-6">In Babylone.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Rd1e236"><name xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Nd1e237" ref="#Bede">BED.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ipetr5-Qd1e240"><seg type="qs">Romam vocat Babylonem propter confusionem multiplicis idololatriae</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">pressura diaboli non potest esse immunis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
